{
    "title": "Car Crash Premium offline",
    "description": "Conduct test drives of cars starting from nines and ending with modern foreign cars at dangerous landfills. List of cars: 2107, 2109, 2110, 2115, Priora, Volga, Vesta, BMW E38, Mercedes w221, Mercedes CLS, BMW M7, Ford ROM, Range Rover, Helik, Chrysler Limousine.\r\n\r\nEXCITING MISSIONS\r\nRealistic physics of car destruction, different types of cars and maps. Complete missions, do car tricks and receive experience and points to upgrade your car or even to buy a new car.\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES:\r\n\r\n* Destroy cars to pieces,\r\n* Realistic physics of car deformation,\r\n* Amazing realistic 3D graphics,\r\n* Various levels of car destruction,\r\n* Various camera modes,\r\n* Realistic car management for better driving simulation,\r\n* Full car destruction.\r\n\r\nENJOY DRIVING\r\nA realistic simulator that allows you to enjoy driving a car due to good physics of car movement, animation of suspension work, elaborated exterior and interior appearance, and also test its strength on a special testing ground thanks to a believable damage system.\r\n\r\nSTART CAR ADVENTURE\r\nIf you hit hard enough, you can make parts of the car fall, the game uses fairly realistic destruction physics for fun. You can use the whole fleet of cars: BMW, Mersedec, sports cars, trucks and motorbikes!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Conduct test drives of cars starting from nines and ending with modern foreign cars at dangerous landfills. List of cars: 2107, 2109, 2110, 2115, Priora, Volga, Vesta, BMW E38, Mercedes w221, Mercedes CLS, BMW M7, Ford ROM, Range Rover, Helik, Chrysler Limousine.<br><br>EXCITING MISSIONS<br>Realistic physics of car destruction, different types of cars and maps. Complete missions, do car tricks and receive experience and points to upgrade your car or even to buy a new car.<br><br>GAME FEATURES:<br><br>* Destroy cars to pieces,<br>* Realistic physics of car deformation,<br>* Amazing realistic 3D graphics,<br>* Various levels of car destruction,<br>* Various camera modes,<br>* Realistic car management for better driving simulation,<br>* Full car destruction.<br><br>ENJOY DRIVING<br>A realistic simulator that allows you to enjoy driving a car due to good physics of car movement, animation of suspension work, elaborated exterior and interior appearance, and also test its strength on a special testing ground thanks to a believable damage system.<br><br>START CAR ADVENTURE<br>If you hit hard enough, you can make parts of the car fall, the game uses fairly realistic destruction physics for fun. You can use the whole fleet of cars: BMW, Mersedec, sports cars, trucks and motorbikes!",
